        <activityName xml:lang="en">Power distribution unit, for electric passenger car</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Power distribution unit, for electric passenger car
This dataset describes a power distribution unit used in the power electronics of the drivetrain for an electric passenger car. It is based on direct informatino frmo the Swiss manufacturer Brusa. The entries are given as a function of kg device. The specific power distribution unit which was used for this dataset weights 3.9 kg and is suitable for a 100kW electric drivetrain.;
UUID: d55703ae-bc31-3185-83c3-d12360cdc5d7
&lt;null&gt;
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: This dataset is based on current, high-level standard.
Time period: Unspecified
Production volume: 35100 kg
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Data on materials and technology has been provided directly by the Swiss manufacturer Brusa. 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_d55703ae-bc31-3185-83c3-d12360cdc5d7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
